  "reason": "The only strong result so far is RNA-only PCA single-profile (0.485 accuracy), while image-only ResNet is weak (0.208 accuracy), leaving uncertainty about whether a learned RNA representation can improve the best modality. config_004 keeps the model setting and single-profile setting fixed and changes only the RNA encoder from PCA to scvi_n200, cleanly isolating the representation effect. This is the best next experiment because it directly compares against the current best RNA baseline before adding more complex choices such as multiprofile aggregation or fusion, and its result will guide whether to invest in scvi-based RNA or multimodal variants."
}

